OL,3,GNEWSAKing's head forester supports
OL,4,A10,000-tree project
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen King Charles III visited Grimsby
OL,7,Fin June, he promised to help with a
OL,8,Fproject to plant 10,000 trees.
OL,10,FOn Thursday, the King's head forester
OL,11,FGeraint Richards arrived in the town to
OL,12,Fhelp community interest company All
OL,13,FThings Good and Nice with its bid to
OL,14,Fplant thousands of trees in Grimsby,
OL,15,FCleethorpes and Immingham.
OL,17,FRichards said: "The King phoned me on
OL,18,Fthe morning he came to Grimsby and saw
OL,19,Fabout this ambition to plant 10,000
OL,20,Ftrees and sent me on a mission.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
