OL,3,GNEWSAKing's head forester supports
OL,4,A10,000-tree project
OL,5,
OL,6,F"At last I'm here and I've fallen in
OL,7,Flove with the place and the people
OL,8,Fbecause there is the most amazing
OL,9,Fspirit here to get something done and
OL,10,Fit's going to happen, I can feel it."
